SUMMARY:2026 FIFA World Cup Final Party! (with Food and Drink Specials) (J
 uly 19th)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nPlease join
  us for a great day as we mix\, mingle and enjoy **the World Cup Final!**\
 n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulo
 us turn out with lots of friendly peers to enjoy the big game with!\n\n**\
 \*Meet us inside Smoke Show between 2:00 pm and 3:00 pm**\n\\*Includes Mix
 \, Mingle and Board games at 1:00 pm and Patio Dinner Party after the Socc
 er game at 5:30 pm :)\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Fle
 mming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**2026 FIFA World Cup Final Par
 ty! (with Food and Drink Specials) (Sunday\, July 19th)**\n\n-A fun\, inte
 ractive\, event with friends\, food and the World Cup Finals Party!\n-Amaz
 ing people\, resereved seating\, great food and beverages\n(Lots of Big Sc
 reen TV's to catch the game)\n-Complimentary Pool Table\, and Food and Dri
 nk specials too\n-Swag and prizes included :)\n\\*Plenty of parking all ar
 ound the venue\n-Free Parking on Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton and -Free 
 Parking on Eglinton (Just west of Mt. Pleasant)\n\\*Stick around after for
  the Patio Dinner party too :)\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n-Arrive any tim
 e between 2:00 pm and 3:30 pm inside the restaurant (ask or look for Steve
 /Organizer when you arrive for our reserved section)\n(1 minute walk from 
 the new Eglinton station at Mt. Pleasant)\n\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (c
 ash only) when you arrive (HST is included)\nor e transfer in advance to [
 Steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://Steveflemming11@gmail.com/)\n(One Bevera
 ge or Appetizer Minimum please to support the staff and restaurant)\nFee i
 ncludes Board Games event\, the Soccer Match and the Patio Dinner Party af
 ter the game :)
