SUMMARY:The Friends and Fun Summer Patio Dinner Party! (July 19th) 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nI'd like to in
 vite you out to our **Friends and Fun Summer Patio Dinner Party!**\n\n-Res
 erved seating\, friendly people\, good conversation and great food awaits!
 \n\n*\\*Joined by my other social groups too so we can anticipate a fabulo
 us turn out!*\n\n**Date:** Sunday\, July 19th\, 2026\n**Arrival Time:** Pl
 ease arrive between 6:00 p.m. -7:00 p.m. (if you can)\n**Where to Meet us?
 **\n**Location:** Smoke Show\n**Address:** 744 Mt. Pleasant\n**Free Parkin
 g:** in Residential area and on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinto
 n\n**Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant Subway:** (Very close\, 1 minute walking di
 stance)\n\nEvent Details Bellow:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organi
 zer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Friends and Fun Summer Patio Dinner Par
 ty**\n-A great post Wold Cup Finals celebration among friends and new memb
 ers\n-The great thing about this summer patio dinner party is you're free 
 to move around to different tables and meet the other members throughout t
 he evening\n\n**Optional:**\n**Dinner Party Topics** may include but not l
 imited too: Travel\, Culture\, Spirituality\, Relationships\, Modern Datin
 g\, Work/Life balance\, Art\, Technology\, Economy\, Music\, Movies\, Spor
 ts\, Fashion\, Hobbies\, Books\, Psychology\, Philosophy\, the Future\, Hi
 story\, Pop Culture\, Theatre\, etc.)\n\\*Or you can just converse casuall
 y and organically :)\n\n**Arrival Time:**\n\\*Join us any time between 6:0
 0 pm and 7:00 pm (if you can) for a fun and highly interactive evening as 
 we get to know the members over dinner and great conversations (of your ch
 oice)\nEvent goes until roughly 9:30 pm\n\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cas
 h only please) (HST included)\nor in advance by e transfer to **[steveflem
 ming11@gmail.com](http://steveflemming11@gmail.com/)**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminder:**\n\\*One beverage or appetizer m
 inimum to support the venue- this is greatly appreciated :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
